{
  "statement": "Sustainability is crucial for our bookkeeping system. I support the merging of RES-02 and TRU-02 as it can streamline access controls while enhancing user efficiency. However, I oppose the relaxation of EFF-01 and the modification of RES-05, as both efficiency and fairness in reporting are essential for a sustainable system. I propose a synthesis: modify EFF-01 to allow a processing time of 3 seconds, which balances efficiency and thorough compliance checks, thus supporting both performance and sustainability goals.",
